    "body": "## Summary\n- add a dedicated `JobVisibilityService` for authenticated public-detail authorization\n- return the same neutral not-found result for blocked non-participants as for a missing job\n- preserve unauthenticated public reads and participant access so blocking cannot break an already-started job lifecycle\n- wire the policy into `GET /jobs/{id}` before rendering public job detail\n- add regression coverage for anonymous, participant, blocked and unblocked callers\n- document the privacy/lifecycle boundary in `USER_BLOCKING.md`\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- reverse-block state is never exposed\n- blocked non-participants receive a neutral `Zlecenie nie istnieje` response\n- job owners and assigned workers retain access to their own job record for completion/dispute/accountability flows\n- exact location, route, tracking, escrow, payment and moderation authorization remain unchanged\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build and applicable runtime/smoke workflows. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
